# Claude Code agent working notes + local settings — repo-local tooling, not part of the release.
# The notes live in a private repository of the team, linked in by the lt-memory plugin: this
# repository is public (decided 2026-11-01). `**/` so the scope under nuxt-base-template/ is covered
# too, since a pattern with a slash in the middle matches only here. No trailing slash: the link is a
# symlink, which a directory-only pattern does not match.
**/.claude/agent-memory
